  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas in Latin America and the Caribbean - Strategic Plan 2015-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the implementation of the coordinated work of Caritas in the Latin America and Caribbean Region for the period 2015-2019.  It covers 4 principle areas of work:  Dignity, Rights and Peace; Integrated and Sustainable Human Development; Environment, Disaster Risk Reduction and Emergencies;  Institutional Strengthening.  There are also 3 cross-cutting themes which are:  Equal Relationships between Men and Women;  Citizen Participation and Advocacy;  Communications.</narrative>
  </description>
